<title>GERMANY: Merck wins hormone patch marketing approval.</title>
<headline>Merck wins hormone patch marketing approval.</headline>
<dateline>DARMSTADT, Germany 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>German drugs group Merck KGaA said on Wednesday the Federal Institute for Drugs and Medicinal Products has approved it to market the hormone patch, FemSeven.</p>
<p>Merck said the 7-day patch is used by post-menopausal women to replace oestrogen and offers protection against post-menopausal osteoporosis.</p>
<p>The patch has been on the market in the UK since 1996 and is to be offered in Germany from September, Merck said.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
